    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned to the remote village of Southshire-Upon-Yail, you must diagnose the afflictions of a young woman that suffers a mysterious illness. Each decision you make will unveil a piece of the mystery and bring you closer to discovering the truth behind her ailments, and whatever harms her. Will you be able to save Isabella before she is taken by her tormentors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424010/extras/9d51bfeeb2881bf3b544d1277d6c2a00.webp?t=1754675086\" width=358 height=35 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The devils inside Isabella will not be removed easily. Navigate the seven creatures that hold her life in her hands, and find a way to expel them one by one \u2013 or succumb to their temptations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424010/extras/504925c2256c93ac67b42918f2bd2782.webp?t=1754675086\" width=429 height=37 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secrets of Hell can be discovered, at a cost, and only through information can your exorcism succeed. But can you trick the demons into exposing their cores, or will you leave yourself open to them? Will you understand the diabolical machine, or fall victim to the devils\u2019 manipulations?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424010/extras/58f17cb42082ababfe1a2396ed16f45d.webp?t=1754675086\" width=134 height=33 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Religious Lore:</strong> Discover a richly crafted narrative where Christian and Hebrew truth intertwine, revealing a secret, arcane vision of Hell. Discover layers of forbidden knowledge, with each demon rooted in ancient myth, yet developed in ways that will chill and captivate you. Hell did not wait for the writers of the scriptures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Gameplay:</strong> Engage in realistic conversations where decisions matter and information can be extracted with the right words, shaping the narrative and leading to a variety of nine endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Demon Encounters:</strong> Identify the possessing demon from a roster of seven cunning adversaries, each with unique personalities and tactics. Find their truth, expose their machinations, and deliver a merciful blow to their hearts, to drive them back to hell. The wrong choice will often mean death: To you, and to all others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral Dilemmas:</strong> Navigate the tension between faith, doubt, and temptation in a story of psychological \u2013 and personal \u2013 horror. Resist, or fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong> Immerse yourself in the Dark Ages, brought to life through hand-drawn artwork and haunting soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Discover every hidden truth and experience multiple paths as you explore the depths of the story. How much is too much? Who hides beneath it all? And have you truly been here before?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to confront the darkness and test your faith? The fate of Isabella\u2019s soul \u2014 and the world \u2014 is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned to the remote village of Southshire-Upon-Yail, you must diagnose the afflictions of a young woman that suffers a mysterious illness. Each decision you make will unveil a piece of the mystery and bring you closer to discovering the truth behind her ailments, and whatever harms her. Will you be able to save Isabella before she is taken by her tormentors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424010/extras/9d51bfeeb2881bf3b544d1277d6c2a00.webp?t=1754675086\" width=358 height=35 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The devils inside Isabella will not be removed easily. Navigate the seven creatures that hold her life in her hands, and find a way to expel them one by one \u2013 or succumb to their temptations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424010/extras/504925c2256c93ac67b42918f2bd2782.webp?t=1754675086\" width=429 height=37 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secrets of Hell can be discovered, at a cost, and only through information can your exorcism succeed. But can you trick the demons into exposing their cores, or will you leave yourself open to them? Will you understand the diabolical machine, or fall victim to the devils\u2019 manipulations?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424010/extras/58f17cb42082ababfe1a2396ed16f45d.webp?t=1754675086\" width=134 height=33 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Religious Lore:</strong> Discover a richly crafted narrative where Christian and Hebrew truth intertwine, revealing a secret, arcane vision of Hell. Discover layers of forbidden knowledge, with each demon rooted in ancient myth, yet developed in ways that will chill and captivate you. Hell did not wait for the writers of the scriptures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Gameplay:</strong> Engage in realistic conversations where decisions matter and information can be extracted with the right words, shaping the narrative and leading to a variety of nine endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Demon Encounters:</strong> Identify the possessing demon from a roster of seven cunning adversaries, each with unique personalities and tactics. Find their truth, expose their machinations, and deliver a merciful blow to their hearts, to drive them back to hell. The wrong choice will often mean death: To you, and to all others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral Dilemmas:</strong> Navigate the tension between faith, doubt, and temptation in a story of psychological \u2013 and personal \u2013 horror. Resist, or fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong> Immerse yourself in the Dark Ages, brought to life through hand-drawn artwork and haunting soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Discover every hidden truth and experience multiple paths as you explore the depths of the story. How much is too much? Who hides beneath it all? And have you truly been here before?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to confront the darkness and test your faith? The fate of Isabella\u2019s soul \u2014 and the world \u2014 is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
